OL,3,GNEWSATram strikes planned until new
OL,4,Ayear cancelled
OL,5,
OL,6,FTram strikes in Nottingham have been
OL,7,Fcancelled after a pay deal was agreed,
OL,8,Foperator Nottingham Express Transit
OL,9,F(NET) has confirmed.
OL,11,FThe GMB Union had planned 25 days of
OL,12,Fstrike action from Thursday to 31
OL,13,FDecember as part of an ongoing pay
OL,14,Fdispute.
OL,16,FTram staff, including drivers,
OL,17,Fticketing staff, control staff,
OL,18,Fengineers, cleaners and office workers,
OL,19,Fhad been in a dispute with NET over pay
OL,20,Fsince January.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
