OL,3,GNEWSATram strikes planned until new
OL,4,Ayear cancelled
OL,5,
OL,6,FNET said a revised pay offer of a 3.7%
OL,7,Fpay increase, and a 7% increase for the
OL,8,Flowest paid roles, had been been
OL,9,Fapproved.
